+// Package tests holds the supplemental P2P regression contracts for the
+// ehco web admin server split (case T6).
+//
+// Every node below drives the real admin server over a real loopback
+// listener and asserts only the public contract: exported entry points,
+// routes, methods, middleware ordering, credentials, payload shapes, query
+// parsing, status mapping, SPA fallback boundaries and the log WebSocket.
+// Nothing here depends on unexported identifiers of internal/web, so a
+// faithful split (handlers moved to dedicated types, narrow dependencies,
+// explicit optional hooks) keeps these nodes green.
+//
+// Each node is executed in its own process by internal/web/tests/runner:
+// web.NewServer registers prometheus collectors exactly once per process,
+// and one-process-per-node also keeps a panic or hang from hiding the
+// other nodes.
+package tests
+
